OL,3,GNEWSACrime linked to asylum centre very
OL,4,Alow, says chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new chief constable at Essex Police
OL,7,Fhas said crime linked to the large
OL,8,Fasylum accommodation in the county is
OL,9,F"very low".
OL,11,FRachel Nolan said there was "absolutely
OL,12,Fno reason" for anyone to be concerned
OL,13,Fabout possible criminality associated
OL,14,Fwith MDP Wethersfield in north Essex.
OL,16,FHer comments followed Essex County
OL,17,FCouncil's decision to fund security
OL,18,Fguards in the areas that these asylum
OL,19,Fseekers visit during the day.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
